L0201: Unknown type

The type name is not in scope. Library types such as Nat are ordinary checked declarations and must be supplied explicitly with the corresponding library input. Check spelling and library arguments instead of assuming every mathematical type is built into the compiler.

Example from `tests/corpus/reject/mathematical_integer.lc`; the full file is a regression test.

```locus
// `Nat` is not in the core yet.
fn first(n: Nat) -> u8 { 1 }
```

Language, as built: [1.3:1](../../atlas.html#/doc/language/spec-1.3:1).
